  <Docs>
    <summary>Provides data for a successful SIP registration.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>This .NET event data class carries the arguments from <see cref="M:Android.Net.Sip.ISipRegistrationListener.OnRegistrationDone(System.String,System.Int64)" />. Its constructor stores the supplied values, and its properties return them unchanged.</para>
      <para>See the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://github.com/dotnet/java-interop/blob/92b5d471f1e0f6164fc332b1f661b472f5cf3aad/tools/generator/SourceWriters/InterfaceEventArgsClass.cs">.NET event data generator</a></format>.</para>
      <para>Portions of this page are modifications based on work created and shared by the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/site-policies" title="Android Open Source Project">Android Open Source Project</a></format> and used according to terms described in the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.5/" title="Creative Commons 2.5 Attribution License">Creative Commons 2.5 Attribution License.</a></format></para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
